Package: dsOMOPClient
Type: Package
Title: DataSHIELD Client for OMOP CDM Databases
Version: 2.5.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("David", "Sarrat González", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "david.sarrat@isglobal.org"),
    person("Xavier", "Escribà-Montagut", role = "aut"),
    person("Juan R", "González", role = "aut"))
Description: Client-side DataSHIELD package for interacting with OMOP CDM
    databases through typed server-side operations. Provides a plan-based API
    for schema exploration, vocabulary operations, cohort management, feature
    engineering, extraction, and selected multi-server policy checks. Includes
    a recipe builder, access to the server's curated query catalog, and selected
    Achilles result contracts. Disclosure safety depends on the corresponding
    server methods and deployment policy; the client does not accept arbitrary
    SQL.
